{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:b4a9e9f91fcb2a40","name":"Docking Clamps","source":{"id":"source:reference-b4a9e9f91fcb2a40","title":"Docking Clamps","revision":18688,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:33:35Z","sha256":"3e15df33ca53ab30540d9ce0e2c85364ec24823545d93b0f1207ad556108279e","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18688","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Docking%20Clamps&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-b4a9e9f91fcb2a40","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Books: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Emplacement Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Emplacement_Points"},":"]}," 1\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size Restriction:"]}," Colossal (Frigate) or Larger\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 2,000 (Base)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Docking Clamps allow a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," to dock with other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships"}," in space. Normally, this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Accessory"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Accessory"}," is used by passengers to move from shuttles to larger ships, but larger vessels can use them as makeshift ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"}," launches. Once the Docking Clamp is in place, creatures can safely move between the clamped ships. A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," can maneuver, fight, and even travel through hyperspace with ships of smaller size clamped to it. However, if a ship takes damage in excess of its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"},", all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships"}," attached to it by Docking Clamps are shaken off.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Docking Clamps on smaller ships aren't strong enough to do much more than hold the ship in place during routine docking. These are built into the cost of all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships"}," and have no special game effect. Docking Clamps can be used to attach only to a willing or disabled ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
